WEBVTT

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:54.770
<i>It appeared as though humanity 
would be destroyed by the demons.</i>

00:01:56.350 --> 00:02:00.370
<i>But a single mage saved them all.</i>

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:06.670
<i>He was called the Wizard King,
and he became a legend.</i>

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:13.960
<b>Clover Kingdom Royal Capital</b>

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:21.480
<i>Time has passed, and the title</i>

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:24.390
<i>of the Wizard King has been 
passed down through generations.</i>

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:29.230
<i>The Wizard King commands the Magic Knights,
and they protect the kingdom together.</i>

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:36.520
<i>The Magic Knights are comprised
of nine squads of mages</i>

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:40.080
<i>that specialize in combat, all under 
the command of the Wizard King.</i>

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:47.870
<i>This band of heroes protects 
the kingdom with their lives.</i>

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:54.430
<i>To become the Wizard King or a Magic Knight 
is the aspiration of all in the Clover Kingdom.</i>

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:21.570
<b>To the Royal Capital of the Clover Kingdom!</b>

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:25.870
<i>Grey words can't make anything happen</i>

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:28.620
<i>I know, yeah I know</i>

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:33.790
<i>Wishing to fly freely across the sky</i>

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:35.880
<i>I dreamed it all my life</i>

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:39.630
<i>Step by step I go, though 
it's a doubtful world </i>

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:41.680
<i>Don't care how much I fall</i>

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:45.150
<i>Instinct is my guide, I never give up</i>

00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:51.520
<i>To faraway future, I burst out running</i>

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:56.690
<i>Go beyond even the unseen fears</i>

00:03:56.690 --> 00:04:02.060
<i>The vision I had, so I can be myself</i>

00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:07.320
<i>Someday I will write the next page</i>

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:10.840
<i>You are my hope</i>

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:13.580
<i>Like that page from someday</i>

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:15.920
<i>I was able to meet you</i>

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:18.880
<i>I call this a miracle</i>

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:32.120
Nine hundred and ninety-five...

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:35.770
Nine hundred and ninety-six...

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:39.190
Nine hundred and ninety-seven...

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:42.290
Nine hundred and ninety-eight...

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:45.190
Nine hundred and ninety-nine...

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:50.580
One thousand!

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:57.320
Now to down some moguro leaf juice!

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:58.880
Gross!

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:00.840
One more gulp!

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.340
Gross!

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:06.840
You want some, too?

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.470
What the heck?

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:21.960
I got my grimoire.

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:27.360
I'm gonna keep climbing up,
even if I don't have any magical powers!

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:29.410
All right! I'm not done yet!

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:30.360
Not even close!

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:32.680
One thousand and one!

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:38.370
I'm sure Yuno's been training, too! I can't lose!

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.880
One thousand and two!

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:46.350
<i>Asta was training for the 
Magic Knights Entrance Exam,</i>

00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:50.870
<i>which was to be held in the royal capital 
of the Clover Kingdom in six months.</i>

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:53.640
<i>So was Yuno.</i>

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:01.690
I should wrap up for today.

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:06.690
No, just a little bit more.

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.650
I'm sure he's also...

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:12.910
One thousand and one!

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:17.290
One thousand and two!

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:24.340
<i>Each one's goal was to one day 
become the Wizard King.</i>

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:30.570
One thousand, five hundred and... three!

00:06:35.430 --> 00:06:38.600
Well, I can understand Yuno...

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:42.600
But are you really considering allowing 
Asta to take the exam, too?

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:46.650
Well, he's saying he wants to do it.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.780
And the ones I was counting on...

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.780
W-We can't do it...

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:57.230
We can't become Magic Knights!

00:06:57.230 --> 00:07:00.870
If someone who was kicked out of 
the Magic Knights was that strong...

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:02.650
There's no way!

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:05.570
We're sorry!

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:12.010
...decided against taking the exam.

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:16.210
Again, I believe Yuno will be fine, 
but I don't think Asta's up for it.

00:07:16.210 --> 00:07:20.280
Well, he's saying he wants to do it.

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:24.520
<i>Again</i>, I believe Yuno will be fine,
but it'll be pointless for Asta to take them.

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:28.770
Well, he's saying he wants to do it.

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:34.850
Actually, the idea of Asta going to the royal
capital just makes you feel lonely, doesn't it?

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:36.740
Aw, Father!

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:38.790
Th-That's not...

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:42.040
I just believe that if he's 
going to fail anyway,

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:44.300
he's better off not taking 
it in the first place.

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:47.520
A-And you know... The little 
ones will miss him, too.

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:50.760
Not me! But they'll have one 
less person to play with!

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:53.430
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:56.050
Not you, too, Tower Master!

00:07:56.050 --> 00:08:00.640
Well, I'll feel a little lonely with 
both Yuno and Asta gone, Father.

00:08:02.050 --> 00:08:06.930
Well, of course, I raised them, and I've lived 
with them ever since they were babies.

00:08:06.930 --> 00:08:09.400
I'd be lying if I said I wasn't 
a bit sad to see them go.

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:13.430
If possible, I'd like for them 
to stay at the church.

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:16.410
But I also want to let them 
do what they want to do.

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:18.280
Indeed.

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:21.170
Besides, you know... Yuno will be fine,

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:24.910
and Asta might fail the exam 
and come right back anyway.

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:28.550
Y-You're right. Right!

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:31.420
Yuno will be fine, but the 
other one will come right back.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:36.360
Um... The book that Asta obtained...

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:39.690
Is it truly a grimoire?

00:08:39.690 --> 00:08:43.060
Asta can't use magic. How was 
he able to obtain a grimoire?

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.370
I'm not sure.

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:47.410
But that's...

00:08:47.410 --> 00:08:48.480
Yes?

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:49.870
No...

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:53.190
Look! Look!

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:55.200
My very own grimoire!

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:58.910
I don't even know how,
 but I was able to get one!

00:09:00.550 --> 00:09:04.540
<i>The five-leaf clover... It couldn't be.</i>

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:11.290
Training's not over until 
I'm back at the church!

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:13.300
Eat my dust!

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:30.750
Goal!

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.680
Yuno! Asta!

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:33.900
Welcome back.

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:36.270
Wh-Who got here faster?

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:40.790
Hmm... Yuno was just a tiny bit faster.

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:43.160
Seriously?! Were you even looking?!

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:48.540
Then I'll race you into the church!

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:55.790
I win.

00:09:57.590 --> 00:10:00.790
Yuno can be pretty childish sometimes.

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:04.100
Yeah, I mean, getting so worked 
up over Asta, of all people?

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:06.050
Not to mention, Yuno...

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:08.310
How many years will this last us?

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:22.470
I'm gonna become the Wizard King.

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:49.670
Yuno?

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:52.770
Did you come to watch me train?

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:54.330
Nash?

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:57.440
What's up?

00:10:57.440 --> 00:11:00.230
Nothing. I was just bored.

00:11:00.230 --> 00:11:03.650
I just came by to make fun of the 
idiot doing something idiotic.

00:11:03.650 --> 00:11:05.280
Whaddya mean, idiotic?!

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:07.360
Well, it is!

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:11.350
You can't even use magic, and you're going 
to take the Magic Knights Entrance Exam?

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:12.580
Of course you're going to fail!

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:14.960
That's not decided yet!

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:17.170
Just look!

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:19.800
I even got a grimoire!

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:22.260
I'm gonna get into the Magic Knights!

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:24.870
And then, one day, I'll become the Wizard Ki—

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.120
That's never gonna happen!

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:33.600
Orphans like us, who are poor... 
aren't allowed to dream like that.

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:35.710
Nash...

00:11:42.110 --> 00:11:44.670
You can't give up right from the get-go!

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:46.990
Possibilities exist in everyone!

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:49.930
Shut up! They do not!

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:52.830
No, they do! I'm going to 
keep chasing my dream!

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:55.750
It doesn't matter if you're 
poor or an orphan.

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:58.150
Anyone in this world can become amazing.

00:11:58.150 --> 00:11:59.990
They can do anything.

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:01.720
They can make their dreams come true.

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:04.250
They can make everyone happy!

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:07.140
And I'll prove that to you!

00:12:07.140 --> 00:12:08.860
Prove?

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:10.760
I'm going to join the Magic Knights

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:13.770
and become the Wizard King!

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:40.160
Tomorrow's the day Asta and Yuno 
set out for the royal capital.

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:42.130
We have to send them off with a bang!

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:47.470
Father went to all the surrounding 
villages asking for tatoes.

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:48.800
Father!

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:51.810
What's that look for?
This isn't just for you!

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:54.680
Actually, it's mostly for Yuno.

00:12:54.680 --> 00:12:55.980
Father!

00:12:56.450 --> 00:13:01.230
Well, you know... Yuno might make it 
into the Magic Knights, but you're...

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:02.470
Father!

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:07.710
Asta, there's no need to be embarrassed, 
even if you fail the exam.

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:08.550
Huh?

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:11.760
No one believes you're going to pass, anyway.

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:15.000
Are you trying to encourage 
me or make fun of me?!

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:17.750
You can come back at any time.

00:13:18.470 --> 00:13:21.170
Your home is this church.

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:25.670
No matter how crappy or poor 
it may be, it's your home.

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:27.790
That's right, Asta.

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:30.650
I'll be lonely without Asta here.

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:31.960
Yuno, too.

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:33.680
We're all family.

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:36.590
Y-You should say that to Yuno, too.

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:38.910
Tell him he can come back
whenever he wants.

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:40.800
Yuno will be fine.

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:44.690
What do you mean?! Besides, I'll be fine, too!

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:46.570
I'm gonna become the Wizard King!

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:49.030
And then... I'm gonna come back for Sister!

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:51.370
So when that happens, marry m—

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:54.970
All right, let's eat.

00:13:54.970 --> 00:13:58.550
We have stewed tatoes,
tato tempura, grilled tatoes,

00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:01.870
fried tatoes, stir-fried 
tatoes, steamed tatoes,

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:06.930
Hage-style boiled tatoes, tato juice, 
and even special tato pudding!

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:10.510
Yay! Let's eat!

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:13.690
So flaky and delicious!

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:14.760
Yummy!

00:14:14.760 --> 00:14:16.230
Hey, that's mine!

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:19.100
Don't eat it all yourself, Asta!

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:20.830
So good!

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:29.750
Take care.

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:32.280
You better write us, Yuno.

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:33.320
Sure.

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:36.160
Good luck!

00:14:36.160 --> 00:14:38.070
Come back soon!

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:40.500
He'll be back soon... Asta, that is.

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:42.060
Nash!

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:42.990
But you know...

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:47.070
If, just if, and it's a very huge if...

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:49.650
If you get into the Magic Knights...

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:50.540
Yeah?

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:55.500
I'll believe in possibilities. 
I'll believe I can become anything.

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:58.560
And then one day, I'll get into 
the Magic Knights, too.

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:01.070
No, never mind.

00:15:01.070 --> 00:15:02.440
I'll be waiting for you.

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:05.600
Well, I'll be off.

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:07.110
Hey, wait, Yuno!

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:10.960
Answer me, you handsome jerk!

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:14.360
Just because we're rivals doesn't 
mean we can't get along!

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:15.870
Hey!

00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:18.870
Well, bye, guys!

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:21.990
Have a safe trip!

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:23.120
See ya.

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:31.290
<i>Yuno and Asta... You've both grown so much.</i>

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:35.720
<i>Asta's always been full of energy.</i>

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:39.770
This is Sister Lily. She'll be 
working here starting today.

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:41.230
All of you, be kind to her.

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:46.110
Wow... Sister Lily.

00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:47.400
Yes?

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:50.400
Please marry me!

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:54.360
I'm sorry! I didn't mean to!

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:56.450
Lily...

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:58.890
He seems happy.

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:04.210
<i>It might be because of Asta...</i>

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:06.880
<i>But Yuno's become so strong.</i>

00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:16.130
Asta...

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:18.680
He's so beaten up.

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:21.260
It's all my fault.

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:22.930
He was protecting me.

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:24.460
What?

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:26.390
Yuno, you sound so...

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:31.330
Asta, stay with us!

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:34.320
Sister Lily...

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:35.950
Asta...

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:38.820
Please marry me.

00:16:38.820 --> 00:16:40.320
Thank goodness.

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:45.110
<i>Do your best, you two.</i>

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:53.850
<i>It is summer. Asta and Yuno start their 
journey to the royal capital in order to take</i>

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:56.340
<i>the Magic Knights Entrance Exam.</i>

00:16:57.590 --> 00:17:01.850
<i>The royal capital is a long, 
long way from Hage Village.</i>

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:08.350
The royal capital, huh... I wonder what it's like.

00:17:08.830 --> 00:17:10.930
I wonder if we'll get 
to meet the Wizard King!

00:17:10.930 --> 00:17:14.070
First, we need to pass the 
Magic Knights entrance exam.

00:17:14.070 --> 00:17:15.480
Then we'll talk.

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:16.860
I'm so excited!

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:20.120
Excited? Aren't you scared?

00:17:20.460 --> 00:17:22.200
Huh? Why would I be?

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:24.710
You never change.

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:27.760
Come on, let's hurry!
The royal capital's super far away!

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:28.580
Hey.

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:31.130
I've gotta hurry up and 
become the Wizard King!

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:33.510
Just because you get there quickly

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:36.380
doesn't mean you'll become the 
Wizard King any quicker.

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:38.880
I'm gonna become the Wizard King, and...

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:45.990
My, Asta, you look so impressive.

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:48.920
Sister... no, my Lily.

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:51.210
I came for you, just as I promised.

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:54.070
I've become the Wizard King. Now, get on.

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:55.570
Okay!

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:58.780
Hold on tight!

00:18:02.610 --> 00:18:03.930
It could happen!

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:06.760
Can you even ride a broom when 
you don't have any magic?

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:09.680
I-I'll make it work!

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:10.510
Will you?

00:18:10.510 --> 00:18:13.910
I will! I got my grimoire!

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:16.630
I can do anything as long as I don't give up!

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:17.880
Come on, hurry up!

00:18:18.220 --> 00:18:20.070
I'm gonna leave you behind, Yuno!

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:22.810
Let's train all the way to the royal capital!

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:24.170
You can't be serious.

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:27.140
Can't keep up, can you, Yuno?

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:36.150
Not done yet... Not yet!

00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:43.480
Stop. We've got a long way to go.

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:47.880
Not yet! I'm not done yet!

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:02.590
Hot! Hot, hot, hot!

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:10.470
I wish everyone back at the 
church could eat this, too.

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:11.610
Yeah.

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:16.110
This way!

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:22.120
No, it's this way.

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:23.610
H-Hey, wait!

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:41.840
Stay out of my way!

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:43.970
I just gave you a hand.

00:19:43.970 --> 00:19:45.710
No one asked you to!

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:50.470
All right!

00:20:08.630 --> 00:20:10.960
My precious moguro leaf juice!

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:32.010
What's the matter, Yuno?

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:40.880
Whoa, it's huge!

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:42.820
So that's the royal capital.

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:45.950
That's where the Wizard King is.

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:53.690
All right! I'm gonna do this!

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:57.560
I'll be right there! Just you wait!

00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:01.340
I'm gonna become the Wizard King!

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:04.670
<i>After a long and perilous journey,</i>

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:08.090
<i>Asta and Yuno arrive at the royal 
capital of the Clover Kingdom.</i>

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:12.950
<i>The Magic Knights Entrance Exam awaits.</i>

00:21:13.650 --> 00:21:20.570
<i>They will now have to compete with many 
powerful opponents and pass the exam!</i>

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:31.980
<i>No one can escape from here</i>

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:38.730
<i>Once again in the small closed off classroom</i>

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:46.970
<i>The star of the class was shining yet again</i>

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:53.420
<i>They shine so bright that I close my eyes</i>

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:56.850
<i>I've thought many times</i>

00:21:57.170 --> 00:22:00.560
<i>That the revolution was within my hands</i>

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:08.160
<i>Isn't it strange? If you want 
to laugh, go ahead and laugh</i>

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:14.990
<i>The rest of us who were left 
behind wanted to become something</i>

00:22:15.300 --> 00:22:22.250
<i>We repeat the same morning over and over</i>

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:29.130
<i>You're the only one who 
can choose your tomorrow</i>

00:22:29.440 --> 00:22:33.860
<i>Let's go beyond our current selves</i>

00:22:55.950 --> 00:23:00.500
<b>Petit Clover</b>

00:22:57.280 --> 00:22:59.560
Petit Clover!

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:04.000
<b>The Mystery of the Grimoire</b>

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:03.130
The Mystery of the Grimoire!

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:08.710
Wait, what? We're small now?

00:23:08.710 --> 00:23:13.890
But man... Our grimoires 
are totally different.

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:15.430
<i>He ignored me?</i>

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:21.370
A grimoire's size and thickness are 
determined by its owner's style.

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:24.770
All right! Let's compare grimoires!

00:23:24.770 --> 00:23:25.740
No.

00:23:24.770 --> 00:23:27.650
That thing's
filthy

00:23:25.740 --> 00:23:26.850
No fair!

00:23:26.850 --> 00:23:28.410
You scared you're gonna lose?

00:23:28.410 --> 00:23:29.910
Not a chance.

00:23:29.910 --> 00:23:33.000
You're getting a big head just because 
you're a little handsome, aren't you?

00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:34.050
Not a chance.

00:23:35.870 --> 00:23:38.660
This is it, Yuno! The Magic Knights 
we admire so much are here!

00:23:38.660 --> 00:23:42.250
Our path to making our dream of becoming 
the Wizard King come true starts here!

00:23:42.250 --> 00:23:46.920
<i>Black Clover,</i> Page 4:
"The Magic Knights Entrance Exam!"

00:23:43.960 --> 00:23:51.140
Page 4

00:23:46.920 --> 00:23:49.840
Not giving up is my magic!
